# Pairs with ClimbsOnlyAfterSeed. A division reported before seeding names a parent the leaves do not know yet.
MODULE: DivisionClimbsBeforeSeed
TARGET: ClimbsOnlyAfterSeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a dividing parent carries its division up before its new sibling has seeded the leaves
PERTURBS: ParentAccept

--- FIND
    /\ seed' = [l \in Leaves |-> "queued"]
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "seed"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ seed' = [l \in Leaves |-> "queued"]
    \* MUTATION: the seeding is not awaited
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "grand"]
--- END
